@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Overall student exam lifecycle. Sources: Student_Desktop_App (LoginViewModel, Core/DeviceFingerprint,
' Core/Readiness/ReadinessPolicy, ViewModels/DashboardViewModel (ConfirmAttendanceAsync, StartExamAsync),
' Services/ApiClient (api/exams/student/start), Views/ExamWindow, Services/Lockdown/LockdownCoordinator,
' Services/LiveMonitoringService), Backend_API (AuthController.StudentLogin, ExamsController.StartExam
' [POST api/exams/student/start], SaveAnswer, Submit, MonitoringController, SubmissionService.FinalizeAsync,
' Services/Grading/*, SessionTimeoutService, GradingController accept-ai, ExamsController answers/{id}/override).
' Simplified labels: endpoints, error codes and model names are given in the chapter text.
' Large font at dpi 96 (PlantUML gaps are fixed in pixels). Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 30
skinparam ArrowFontSize 29
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 31
}

|Student|
start
:Enter ID and
password;
|Desktop App|
:Send login with
device fingerprint;
|Server|
if (Login and
device OK?) then ([no])
  :Refuse;
  stop
else ([yes: tokens])
endif
|Desktop App|
repeat
:Run 7 readiness
checks, send results;
repeat while (Required
check failed?) is ([yes])
-> [no];
|Student|
:Check in,
press Start;
|Desktop App|
:Request exam start;
|Server|
if (Eligible, open,
seat and readiness
OK?) then ([no])
  :Refuse;
  stop
else ([yes])
  :Start or resume
  the session;
endif
|Desktop App|
fork
  |Student|
  :Answer
  questions;
fork again
  |Desktop App|
  :Lockdown, auto-save,
  heartbeat, events,
  captures, webcam AI;
  |Server|
  :Store, push to
  live monitor;
  |Desktop App|
end fork
:Session ends: submit,
timer, force-submit
or timeout;
|Server|
:Finalise with receipt,
auto-grade if AI on,
plagiarism check if
not practice;
|Desktop App|
:Release lockdown,
verify receipt or
show Exam Ended;
|Server|
:Run code tests
in background;
|Teacher|
:Accept AI marks
or override;
stop
@enduml
